WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.324
Lab 2 runs the export live against your
own ServiceNow developer instance,

2
00:00:05.324 --> 00:00:08.812
with at least one finding
closed in Module 6's Lab 2.

3
00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:12.937
Create the evidence reader, and check
its role against the kit's call list.

4
00:00:12.937 --> 00:00:16.765
That matters: the export runs
under its own read-only role,

5
00:00:16.765 --> 00:00:21.488
never the verifier's, because the
verifier's role could close findings.

6
00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.426
Export live from your instance.

7
00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:26.366
Check the date format of
the due and finished values,

8
00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:29.650
since that's one of the things
the workbook couldn't verify.

9
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.112
Then verify the package,
exactly as you did in Lab 1.

10
00:00:33.112 --> 00:00:36.244
Back it out by deleting
the live output folder and

11
00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:39.300
the evidence reader's OAuth
client, user and role.

12
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.520
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
